Piper TTS voice: hi_IN-pratham-medium (Hindi)
================================================================================
Used by: services/ai/render/ (English-pivot -> Hindi speech)

- Voice model trained by PravalX (https://github.com/PravalX), distributed via
  the rhasspy/piper-voices Hugging Face repository.
- Training data: AI4Bharat's indicnlp_corpus
  (https://github.com/AI4Bharat/indicnlp_corpus).
