================================================================================
Piper TTS voice: te_IN-maya-medium (Telugu)
================================================================================
Used by: services/ai/render/ (English-pivot -> Telugu speech)

- Voice model fine-tuned from the US English "lessac" voice, using IIT
  Madras's IndicTTS Telugu data (https://www.iitm.ac.in/donlab/indictts),
  distributed via the rhasspy/piper-voices Hugging Face repository.
- License: per IIT Madras's IndicTTS license terms
  (https://www.iitm.ac.in/donlab/indictts/downloads/license.pdf).

